  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8b7b0556d2c5864182957a5734cc9db, type: 3}
  m_Name: KopukEfendi
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BilgiAdasi::BilgiAdasi.City.NpcProfile
  displayName: "K\xF6p\xFCk Efendi"
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6f1b36aaa9ae8ac45b6607ef6876ef98, type: 3}
  promptFormat: "{0} ile konu\u015F"
  conversations:
  - lines:
    - "Dikkat! Az \xF6nce yine bir \u015Fey k\xF6p\xFCrd\xFC. Ka\u015Flar\u0131m
      h\xE2l\xE2 yerinde mi?"
    - "Alt\u0131n kural: \xF6nce oran\u0131 bul, sonra kazana d\xF6k."
  - lines:
    - "\xC7e\u015Fme suyu mu, dam\u0131t\u0131lm\u0131\u015F su mu? Sak\u0131n tad\u0131na
      bakarak anlamaya \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma!"
  - lines:
    - "C\xE2bir Usta'n\u0131n \xE7\u0131ra\u011F\u0131 sen misin? Benden biraz uzak
      dur, bug\xFCn \u015Fanss\u0131z g\xFCn\xFCmdeyim!"
